    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><strong>Horizon\u2019s Edge</strong> is an open-world survival game set in a world overrun by zombies. Up to 100 players compete for survival in a hostile environment filled with dangerous NPC enemies, zombies, and wildlife such as deer.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866470/extras/f7d1bd0efe988dc3908c2e5750e231ad.poster.avif?t=1722541624\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866470/extras/f7d1bd0efe988dc3908c2e5750e231ad.webm?t=1722541624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866470/extras/f7d1bd0efe988dc3908c2e5750e231ad.mp4?t=1722541624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Setting and Environment</h2>Explore a landscape with mountains, forests, small islands, military base and more! The dynamic environment includes changing weather and time of day, adding to the challenge of survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866470/extras/0379d523791cf9e95bc2b9bd9ee78752.poster.avif?t=1722541624\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866470/extras/0379d523791cf9e95bc2b9bd9ee78752.webm?t=1722541624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866470/extras/0379d523791cf9e95bc2b9bd9ee78752.mp4?t=1722541624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Mechanics</h2>One of your biggest enemies are hunger, thirst, and health. Manage these by finding food, water, and medical supplies. Gather resources, hunt animals for food and craft weapons, tools to protect yourself from zombies, NPC enemies, and other players.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866470/extras/f7145103a81e86817c92784d41ea6870.poster.avif?t=1722541624\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866470/extras/f7145103a81e86817c92784d41ea6870.webm?t=1722541624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866470/extras/f7145103a81e86817c92784d41ea6870.mp4?t=1722541624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Zombies, Npc Enemies, and Wildlife</h2>Face off against various types of zombies, hostile non-playable characters (NPCs) that want to kill you, and hunt animals. NPCs are controlled by intelligent AI, making them unpredictable and dangerous.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866470/extras/84c91b8a06ec153054e2f7a95a5d9054.avif?t=1722541624\" width=600 height=326 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer Interaction</h2>Form alliances or compete against other survivors in a game where you can't trust anyone. Every interaction with another player can be a potential danger or a good opportunity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866470/extras/1eae459cf06e059361b0f62f3c9089e8.avif?t=1722541624\" width=600 height=336 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategy and Exploration</h2>Develop strategies for survival, by forming alliances or going solo. Explore the open world to find resources, build structures, and secure a lead over other survivors.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><strong>Horizon\u2019s Edge</strong> is an open-world survival game set in a world overrun by zombies. Up to 100 players compete for survival in a hostile environment filled with dangerous NPC enemies, zombies, and wildlife such as deer.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866470/extras/f7d1bd0efe988dc3908c2e5750e231ad.poster.avif?t=1722541624\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866470/extras/f7d1bd0efe988dc3908c2e5750e231ad.webm?t=1722541624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866470/extras/f7d1bd0efe988dc3908c2e5750e231ad.mp4?t=1722541624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Setting and Environment</h2>Explore a landscape with mountains, forests, small islands, military base and more! The dynamic environment includes changing weather and time of day, adding to the challenge of survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866470/extras/0379d523791cf9e95bc2b9bd9ee78752.poster.avif?t=1722541624\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866470/extras/0379d523791cf9e95bc2b9bd9ee78752.webm?t=1722541624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866470/extras/0379d523791cf9e95bc2b9bd9ee78752.mp4?t=1722541624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Mechanics</h2>One of your biggest enemies are hunger, thirst, and health. Manage these by finding food, water, and medical supplies. Gather resources, hunt animals for food and craft weapons, tools to protect yourself from zombies, NPC enemies, and other players.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866470/extras/f7145103a81e86817c92784d41ea6870.poster.avif?t=1722541624\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866470/extras/f7145103a81e86817c92784d41ea6870.webm?t=1722541624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866470/extras/f7145103a81e86817c92784d41ea6870.mp4?t=1722541624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Zombies, Npc Enemies, and Wildlife</h2>Face off against various types of zombies, hostile non-playable characters (NPCs) that want to kill you, and hunt animals. NPCs are controlled by intelligent AI, making them unpredictable and dangerous.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866470/extras/84c91b8a06ec153054e2f7a95a5d9054.avif?t=1722541624\" width=600 height=326 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer Interaction</h2>Form alliances or compete against other survivors in a game where you can't trust anyone. Every interaction with another player can be a potential danger or a good opportunity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866470/extras/1eae459cf06e059361b0f62f3c9089e8.avif?t=1722541624\" width=600 height=336 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategy and Exploration</h2>Develop strategies for survival, by forming alliances or going solo. Explore the open world to find resources, build structures, and secure a lead over other survivors.",
    "short_description": "In Horizon\u2019s Edge it's simple: survive! Whether it's the environment, animals, or other players, everything's a threat. Just stay alive, no matter what.",
